###############################################################################
# BLEAK - .gitignore for a KSP configuration mod
###############################################################################

## Release packaging output
# The distributable is a zip of GameData/. Built on demand, never committed.
build/
dist/
release/
*.zip

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.iml
.settings/
.metadata/
.classpath
.project
*.bak
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## KSP runtime artefacts
# Written by the game beside an installed copy of the mod. Logs are machine
# specific, and TUFX writes its own working copies of profiles through the
# in-game editor. Neither belongs in the repository.
KSP.log
*.log
Logs/
PluginData/

## Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# Scratch notes and reference material kept next to the repo so profiles can be
# compared against other mods' work. Other people's files under other people's
# terms; this mod ships none of them.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
external-files/
NOTES.md
